# Public-repository safety boundary
#
# This file protects local/private material before the repository is initialized.
# If a matching file is ever committed, ignoring it later is not enough: remove it
# from the index/history and rotate any exposed credential before publishing.

# Secrets, credentials, and machine-local environment
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.envrc
.direnv/
.npmrc
.pypirc
.netrc
credentials*.json
client_secret*.json
service-account*.json
service_account*.json
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore
*.kdbx
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json

# Internal AI-agent, project-control, tracker, continuity, and evidence material
/.codex-ops/
